# Cron example — not installed. See docs/REFRESH.md.
#
# Fields: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week   command
# Replace /path/to/9-router-follow-up with this repo's absolute path.
#
# every 6 hours, on the hour
0 */6 * * *   /path/to/9-router-follow-up/ops/refresh.sh
#
# daily at 08:05
# 5 8 * * *   /path/to/9-router-follow-up/ops/refresh.sh
#
# hourly, offline only (no OpenRouter fetch, cache may be stale)
# 0 * * * *   env REFRESH_ARGS="--offline" /path/to/9-router-follow-up/ops/refresh.sh
